  "checklist": [
    "I form the regular preterite with -é, -aste, -ó / -í, -iste, -ió.",
    "I write busqué, llegué, empecé, leyó.",
    "I know fui, tuve, hice, estuve, pude, dije, vine.",
    "I use the preterite for finished actions at a specific time."
